{"reviewId": "276023870_869uzFxdt", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "2026年是**“资产通缩 + 生活滞胀”**的混合体\n#### 1. 应对“资产通缩” —— **现金为王，不要负债**\n*   **现象：** 房子、车子、甚至很多股票还在跌。\n*   **对策：** 别去接盘旧资产。如果你有现金，你在资产端的购买力其实是变强的。**千万不要在这个时候背债买房。**\n#### 2. 应对“货币滞胀” —— **持有黄金，锁定购买力**\n*   **现象：** 央行只要一救市，手里的纸币就贬值。\n*   **对策：** 黄金是专门克制“央行乱印钱”的。当下一轮救市潮来临时（也许就在几个月后），黄金会跳涨，帮你抵消生活成本的上升。\n#### 3. 应对“收入停滞” —— **投资新生产力**\n*   **现象：** 靠死工资涨不动了。\n*   **对策：** 定投**科创/AI/新能源**。这是未来唯一能跑赢滞胀、创造超额收益的地方。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "12434-12464", "abstract": "未来5年，我们研究的重点不是如何防范通缩，而是如何应对滞胀。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "276023870_869uzFxdt", "userVid": 276023870, "topics": [], "createTime": 1768389746, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 276023870, "name": "耕心若溪", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEJibQhvqnuGLLR8pAkWtibbs16LcLIwhz4klZ22YTLalWl20NvBS4AwmK7iaALL72OLCg7S6OaFfGtVArwaLsrvPq8OMoSHX7sPVriaqsSdOwndCg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "耕心若溪", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-0-0-B-6-6-1", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 0}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 60, "likes": [{"userVid": 48841860, "name": "无二", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0022-1FCgNXFcjWQEhYftvdDoI10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "无二", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "